'''Cursed Strength''' (呪われた力, ''Norowareta Chikara'', '''Cursed Power''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 5.3 Update|Version 5.3]].

==Effect==
Cat Cannon Recharge UP (M): Cat Cannon will charge 15 seconds faster.

